  "A wobbly pen drawing on notebook paper, with sweat drops and comments about the exercise. Highlighter marks the working muscles.": "一支摇摇晃晃的笔在笔记本纸上画画，上面有汗珠和对练习的评论。荧光笔标记工作肌肉。",
  "about": "关于",
  "About {count} hours remaining.": "还剩大约 {count} 小时。",
  "About {count} minutes remaining.": "还剩大约 {count} 分钟。",
  "about {weeks} weeks": "约{weeks}周",
  "About 1,800 particles form a body and leave light trails in space. Working muscles turn gold.": "大约 1,800 个粒子形成一个物体，并在太空中留下光迹。工作的肌肉变成金色。",
  "About 25 exercises in 45–60 min: backward sled, posture work, Knees-Over-Toes leg work, high-rep accessories (1 × 25), 10-min HIIT three times a week.": "45-60 分钟内进行约 25 项练习：向后雪橇、姿势训练、膝盖覆盖脚趾腿部训练、高次数配件 (1 × 25)、每周 3 次、每次 10 分钟的 HIIT。",
  "About 75 min of hard cardio: 54 min of controlled vigorous work on Tue/Thu/Sat, 16 work minutes in Thursday’s 4×4 and 5 min 20 s of Tuesday’s bursts. Easy recoveries, warm-ups, jumps and strength sets are not credited as hard cardio.": "大约 75 分钟的有氧运动：周二/周四/周六 54 分钟的受控剧烈运动，周四的 4×4 运动 16 分钟，周二的突发运动 5 分 20 秒。简单的恢复、热身、跳跃和力量组不被认为是硬性有氧运动。",
