  "Add or edit your equipment during setup or in Settings under Your equipment. These home exercises stand in for Bryan's gym exercises.": "在设置过程中或在“您的设备”下的“设置”中添加或编辑您的设备。这些家庭练习代替了布莱恩的健身房练习。",
  "Add set": "添加集合",
  "Add set is a labelled button at the end of the last set row. Set cards stay narrow and extra sets scroll inside their box.": "添加集是最后一个集行末尾的带标签按钮。套装卡保持狭窄状态，额外的套装在其盒子内滚动。",
  "Add set stays at the end of the last set row, and the timer and remove buttons line up across every row.": "添加组停留在最后一组行的末尾，计时器和删除按钮在每一行上排列。",
  "Add weight only when you hit the top of the rep range on every set with clean form, two sessions in a row: about +{kg:1-2} per dumbbell for upper body, +{kg:2-4} for legs. Bryan’s protocol stresses progressive overload: increase the load gradually.": "仅当您以干净的形式在每组中达到最高次数时才添加重量，连续两次：上半身每个哑铃约 +{kg:1-2}，腿部 +{kg:2-4}。布莱恩的协议强调渐进式超负荷：逐渐增加负荷。",
  "Add weight only when you hit the top of the rep range on every set with clean form, two sessions in a row: about +0.5–1 kg per dumbbell for upper body, +1–2.5 kg for legs. Bryan’s protocol stresses progressive overload: increase the load gradually.": "仅当您以干净的形式达到每组次数范围的顶部时才增加重量，连续两次：上半身每个哑铃约+0.5-1公斤，腿部+1-2.5公斤。布莱恩的协议强调渐进式超负荷：逐渐增加负荷。",
  "Add your own equipment below.": "在下面添加您自己的设备。",
