  "Add-on repeat and Sunday controls sit on one compact line in Settings.": "附加重复和周日控件位于“设置”中的一条紧凑线上。",
  "Add-on repeats appear on their exact cycle days again; every 3 days no longer shows the add-on daily.": "附加重复再次出现在其确切的周期日；每 3 天不再每天显示该附加组件。",
  "Add-on repeats now count from the last completed or skipped day and stay available until done, instead of appearing only on exact cycle days.": "附加重复现在从最后完成或跳过的一天开始计数，并保持可用直到完成，而不是仅在确切的周期日出现。",
