  "An anime figure with big eyes and spiky hair. Soft shading and thin outlines define the body.": "有着大眼睛和尖尖头发的动漫人物。柔和的阴影和纤细的轮廓定义了身体。",
  "An in-workout audio coach for interval training: spoken cues for work intervals, recovery blocks, heart-rate target reminders, 30-second warnings, and a voice toggle in the interval timer and Settings.": "用于间歇训练的锻炼中音频教练：工作间歇的语音提示、恢复块、心率目标提醒、30 秒警告以及间歇计时器和设置中的语音切换。",
  "Anchor a band at chest height behind you (door hinge side) or wrap it around your upper back.": "将一根带子固定在您身后胸部高度处（门铰链侧）或将其缠绕在您的上背部。",
