  "Animation styles (a test): nine ways to draw the exercise animation, for now only on Zone 2 (\"Easy step-ups or marching\"); every other exercise keeps the mannequin. Mannequin, Athlete (semi-realistic), Anime (cel-shaded), Low poly, Cartoon (ink outlines) and Voxel are three.js scenes; Pictogram (SVG), Ink brush (2D canvas) and ASCII (text) are drawn without three.js. All of them play the same movement.": "动画风格（测试）：九种绘制练习动画的方法，目前仅适用于第 2 区（“轻松上步或行进”）；所有其他练习都会保留人体模型。 Mannequin、Athlete（半写实）、Anime（卡通着色）、Low Poly、Cartoon（墨水轮廓）和 Voxel 是三个 .js 场景；象形图（SVG）、毛笔（2D 画布）和 ASCII（文本）的绘制无需 Three.js。他们都演奏相同的动作。",
