  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "在较简单的级别，慢慢移动，直到你学会了动作。",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "每周至少 120 分钟的预定 2 区运动和约 51 分钟的有氧运动；周二、周四和周六控制了活跃的街区。",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning，保持轻快的步伐，全力以赴。 At Active，努力吧。 At Well trained，全力以赴。",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above，双手各握一个哑铃，或将一根带子绕在腰上，锚点在您面前。乐队应该像雪橇一样拉着你前进。",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning，用手往上推。 At higher levels，用腿筋把自己拉回来。",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "在最后一次间隔结束时，记下您的峰值心率。轻轻步行 60 秒，再次记录您的心率。输入下降值（峰值减去 60 秒读数）。",
