  "Balance is one of Bryan’s five exercise pillars (his May 2026 video). His free biological-age check uses a one-leg stand with eyes closed. Being able to stand on one leg for 10 s is linked with lower all-cause mortality.": "平衡是 Bryan 的五个锻炼支柱之一（他的 2026 年 5 月视频）。他的免费生物年龄检查采用的是闭着眼睛的单腿站立方式。能够单腿站立 10 秒与降低全因死亡率有关。",
