  "Blueprint’s guidance after 40: strength train 2–3 times a week, cover the major muscle groups with compound movements and gradually increase reps or load. Start with bodyweight if new.": "Blueprint对40岁后的指导：每周力量训练2-3次，用复合动作覆盖主要肌肉群，并逐渐增加次数或负荷。如果是新手，请从体重开始。",
  "Blueprint's title block names the exercise, and it dimensions steps and boxes only when there is one. Doodle has jokes for each kind of exercise and tallies the reps as they're counted; its speech bubble no longer covers the figure.": "蓝图的标题栏为练习命名，并且仅在存在步骤和框时才标注其尺寸。 Doodle 为每种锻炼提供了笑话，并在计算时记录重复次数；它的讲话泡泡不再覆盖这个数字。",
