  "Bones remodel when subjected to high-rate mechanical loads. Heel drops, stomps, and hops generate 3–4× bodyweight ground-reaction forces.": "当承受高速率机械负载时，骨骼会重塑。脚跟着地、跺脚和跳跃会产生 3-4 倍体重的地面反作用力。",
