  "Bryan 2026: jumps for fast-twitch power": "布莱恩 2026：跳跃以获得快肌力量",
  "Bryan adds a weighted vest during Zone 2 walks and hikes to increase axial bone loading safely.": "Bryan 在 2 区步行和远足期间添加了加重背心，以安全地增加轴向骨负荷。",
  "Bryan calls the phone the worst trigger for bad posture. Hold it at eye level and put the top of your monitor at eye level too.": "布莱恩称手机是导致不良姿势的最糟糕的诱因。将其保持在与眼睛水平的位置，并将显示器的顶部也放在与眼睛水平的位置。",
  "Bryan calls this technical and was taught it for his own diagnosed condition. Stay gentle, and stop if you get dizziness, tingling or a headache.": "布莱恩称这是技术性的，并且是根据他自己诊断出的病情来教授的。保持轻柔，如果感到头晕、刺痛或头痛，请停止。",
  "Bryan demonstrates it at {time} ({clock})": "Bryan 在 {time} ({clock}) 上进行了演示",
  "Bryan did 1 × 10 in 2023. His 2025 Galpin session includes Nordic curls in the strength block. They protect against hamstring strains.": "布莱恩在 2023 年进行了 1 × 10 次训练。他在 2025 年加尔平训练中的力量组包括北欧弯举。它们可以防止腿筋拉伤。",
  "Bryan does “butterfly pulls” with a resistance band, 1 × 15. Most write-ups describe it as a band chest fly; watch his clip to copy his exact version.": "布莱恩用阻力带 1 × 15 进行“蝴蝶拉”。大多数文章将其描述为带胸飞翔；观看他的剪辑以复制他的确切版本。",
  "Bryan does 3 × 10 per leg, learned from Ben Patrick, the Knees-Over-Toes coach working with him on his 2026 dunk project. It builds the inner quad (VMO) and knee resilience.": "布莱恩从与他一起开展 2026 年扣篮项目的膝上脚趾教练本·帕特里克 (Ben Patrick) 那里学到了每条腿 3 × 10 次的训练。它可以增强股四头肌内侧 (VMO) 和膝盖的弹性。",
  "Bryan does both grips": "布莱恩同时进行两种握法",
  "Bryan does both. His 2025 Galpin session includes them in the strength block at 2 × 5–8. His official beginner list uses assisted pull-ups.": "布莱恩两者兼而有之。他的 2025 年 Galpin 训练中将其纳入 2 × 5-8 的力量组中。他的官方初学者名单使用辅助引体向上。",
  "Bryan does the Pallof press in his 2025 session with Dr. Andy Galpin. It trains the trunk to resist twisting.": "布莱恩 (Bryan) 在 2025 年与安迪·加尔平 (Andy Galpin) 博士会面时进行帕洛夫推举 (Pallof Press)。它训练躯干抵抗扭曲。",
  "Bryan does tibialis raises (1 × 25, single-leg in his list). His 2026 dunk notes mention limited ankle dorsiflexion. This exercise works on that movement.": "布莱恩进行胫骨提举（1 × 25，在他的清单中是单腿）。他的 2026 年扣篮笔记提到了脚踝背屈有限。这个练习针对那个动作。",
  "Bryan has been training to dunk at 49 since July 2026, using heavy lifts with jumps between sets. He says he needs more fast-twitch fibres and faster force development, and warns about Achilles risk from landing forces. Learn to land before working on height.": "自 2026 年 7 月以来，布莱恩一直在 49 岁时进行扣篮训练，使用大重量举重和组间跳跃。他说他需要更多的快肌纤维和更快的力量发展，并警告登陆部队的跟腱风险。在进行高空作业之前先学会着陆。",
