  "Bryan Johnson's zero-blood, at-home physical testing battery. Track your functional biomarkers against elite 18-year-old and longevity longevity percentiles.": "布莱恩·约翰逊的零血家庭物理测试电池。根据 18 岁精英和长寿百分位数跟踪您的功能生物标志物。",
  "Bryan measures grip strength as a primary longevity biomarker (scoring ~60 kg, top 5% of all ages). Hanging decompresses the spine and builds forearm grip endurance.": "Bryan 将握力作为主要的长寿生物标志物进行测量（得分约为 60 公斤，在所有年龄段中排名前 5%）。悬挂可以减轻脊柱压力并增强前臂的握力耐力。",
