  "Bryan opens his workouts with a backward sled drag (about 2 min in his 2023 routine, still first in his 2025 warm-up with Dr. Andy Galpin). It works the knees and quads using the Knees-Over-Toes approach.": "布莱恩以向后拉雪橇开始训练（在他 2023 年的训练中大约 2 分钟，仍然是他 2025 年与安迪·加尔平博士一起热身的第一场训练）。它使用膝盖覆盖脚趾的方法来锻炼膝盖和股四头肌。",
  "Bryan puts injury prevention first. If a joint hurts, open the exercise and switch to its easier version.": "布莱恩将伤害预防放在首位。如果关节疼痛，请打开练习并切换到更简单的版本。",
  "Bryan shared this tip in April 2026 for days spent sitting. In the study he cited, squat breaks improved blood sugar more than one 30-minute walk. He stressed taking breaks from sitting.": "布莱恩于 2026 年 4 月分享了这个静坐的秘诀。在他引用的一项研究中，深蹲休息对血糖的改善效果比步行 30 分钟还要好。他强调不要久坐，要休息一下。",
  "Bryan spends weekends hiking, biking, climbing or playing pickleball at an easy pace. Your indoor session combines controlled vigorous cardio at your level, a long Zone 2 block and 20 min of stretching. This is the second posture strength day.": "布莱恩周末会以轻松的节奏徒步旅行、骑自行车、攀岩或打匹克球。您的室内训练结合了适合您水平的有控制的剧烈有氧运动、长时间的 2 区训练和 20 分钟的伸展运动。这是第二个姿势力量日。",
  "Bryan targets at least 75 min of high-intensity cardio a week, with only about 10 min near maximum effort. This home block supplies controlled vigorous minutes alongside his Tuesday bursts and Thursday 4×4; its duration is set for this home plan and differs from the sessions in his sample week.": "Bryan 的目标是每周至少进行 75 分钟的高强度有氧运动，其中接近最大强度的运动时间仅为 10 分钟左右。这个主场提供了控制有力的分钟以及他周二的爆发和周四的 4×4；其持续时间是为此家庭计划设置的，与他的样本周中的课程不同。",
  "Bryan tests ~60 kg (top 5% across all ages). Handgrip strength is a primary biological age biomarker in clinical longevity literature.": "Bryan 测试约为 60 公斤（所有年龄段中排名前 5%）。握力是临床长寿文献中的主要生物学年龄生物标志物。",
  "Bryan tests at ~64 ml/kg/min (top 1% 18yo). Cardiovascular fitness is the single strongest statistical predictor of longevity.": "Bryan 测试约为 64 毫升/公斤/分钟（18 岁前 1%）。心血管健康是长寿的唯一最强的统计预测因素。",
  "Bryan trains obliques for 1 × 25: on the hyperextension bench in 2023, as oblique side bends in his 2025 conditioning block.": "布莱恩于 2023 年在超伸展长凳上训练斜肌 1 × 25，同时在 2025 年的体能训练中训练斜肌侧弯。",
