  "Bryan’s 2025 Galpin session includes these in the speed and power block (2 × 5). You need about 2 m of clear floor to move sideways.": "Bryan 的 2025 年 Galpin 课程将这些内容纳入速度和力量模块 (2 × 5)。您需要大约 2 m 的净地面才能侧向移动。",
  "Bryan’s 2025 session has a rotational power slot (2 × 5), and his Bone Density protocol lists medicine-ball throws. Use a fast band chop at home.": "布莱恩的 2025 年训练有一个旋转力量槽 (2 × 5)，他的骨密度协议列出了药球投掷。在家使用快速带斩。",
  "Bryan’s 2026 dunk training is built on heavy pulls (a 385 lb, about 175 kg, PR on 4 Sep 2026, followed straight away by jumps), and his bone protocol names deadlifts. The dumbbell Romanian deadlift provides the heavy hip-hinge work in this plan.": "布莱恩 2026 年的扣篮训练以大拉力为基础（385 磅，约 175 公斤，2026 年 9 月 4 日的个人纪录，随后立即进行跳跃），他的骨骼协议将其命名为硬拉。哑铃罗马尼亚硬拉在该计划中提供了重型髋关节铰链工作。",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026) puts jumping and hopping into the warm-up 4–7 times a week. He mentions stiff tendons and Achilles risk in his 2026 dunk training notes. This plan gives the tendons a small daily dose of work.": "布莱恩的骨密度方案（2026 年 4 月）将跳跃和跳跃纳入每周 4-7 次热身活动。他在 2026 年扣篮训练笔记中提到了肌腱僵硬和跟腱风险。这个计划每天给肌腱做少量的工作。",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026): high ground-reaction shockwaves stimulate osteoblast mineral deposition to maintain 99th percentile bone density.": "布莱恩的骨密度方案（2026 年 4 月）：高地面反应冲击波刺激成骨细胞矿物质沉积，以维持 99% 的骨密度。",
  "Bryan’s Friday session in his newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026) includes step-ups at 3 × 10 per leg. His bone protocol also uses box step-ups for power training.": "布莱恩在其最新的每周模板（锻炼通讯，2026 年 10 月 4 日）中的周五训练中包括每条腿 3 × 10 次的升步。他的骨骼方案还使用箱式升压进行力量训练。",
  "Bryan’s Friday template: lunges, overhead press, chest press, step-ups and side planks. Start with power work in Galpin’s order, then use Bryan’s 2026 pairing of heavy hip hinges followed by jumps.": "布莱恩的周五模板：弓步、过头推举、胸部推举、上台阶和侧平板支撑。按照 Galpin 的顺序开始力量练习，然后使用 Bryan 2026 配对的重型髋关节铰链，然后进行跳跃。",
  "Bryan’s guide says holding good posture uses muscles that may feel sore at first. Sharp pain, tingling or headaches are reasons to stop and get checked.": "布莱恩的导游说，保持良好的姿势会用到一开始可能会感到酸痛的肌肉。剧烈疼痛、刺痛或头痛是停下来接受检查的原因。",
  "Bryan's gym exercise": "布莱恩的健身房锻炼",
  "Bryan’s mobility and strength exercises, including pulling, Knees-Over-Toes work and high-rep arm work, followed by Zone 2 toward his weekly target. This is the first of two posture strength days.": "Bryan 的灵活性和力量练习，包括拉动、膝盖覆盖脚趾练习和高次数手臂练习，然后进行 2 区练习，以实现他的每周目标。这是两个姿势力量日中的第一天。",
  "Bryan’s official light day: 20–30 min of gentle yoga or stretching.": "布莱恩的官方轻日：20-30 分钟的轻柔瑜伽或伸展运动。",
  "Bryan’s official list: arm circles, wall slides, thread the needle, hip CARs.": "布莱恩的官方清单：手臂绕圈、墙壁滑梯、穿针引线、臀部汽车。",
  "Bryan’s official protocol includes both versions in its stability exercises: the single-leg RDL and single-leg toe touch.": "布莱恩的官方协议在其稳定性练习中包括两个版本：单腿 RDL 和单腿脚趾接触。",
  "Bryan’s official warm-up uses arm circles, leg swings, high knees and lateral lunges. Hip CARs and the lunge with twist come from his mobility day and his 2025 warm-up with Dr. Andy Galpin.": "布莱恩的正式热身包括手臂绕圈、腿部摆动、高膝和侧弓步。时髦的 CAR 和扭转的弓箭步来自他的活动日以及他与安迪·加尔平 (Andy Galpin) 博士一起进行的 2025 年热身活动。",
  "Bryan’s official yoga block includes cat-cow, cobbler’s pose, tree pose and cobra. Stay longer when you have time; his version lasts 15 min.": "布莱恩的官方瑜伽模块包括猫牛式、鞋匠式、树式和眼镜蛇式。有时间的时候多呆一会儿；他的版本持续15分钟。",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #1. Official wording (2026): “With weights in your hands, bring your shoulders up and out. Keep your elbows back. Do 1 set to fatigue 2 times a week.” He uses about 9 kg (20 lb); his posture coach’s patients usually start near 3.5 kg (8 lb).": "布莱恩的物理治疗师练习#1。官方措辞（2026）：“手中握有重物，肩膀向上并向外。保持肘部向后。每周做 2 次 1 组以达到疲劳。”他使用了大约 9 公斤（20 磅）；他的姿势教练的患者通常体重在 3.5 公斤（8 磅）左右。",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #2. Official wording (2026): “With a hand on your forehead, resist the pressure of your hand pushing your head back. When doing this, be very patient.” He does it to fatigue twice a week.": "布莱恩的物理治疗师练习#2。官方措辞（2026）：“将手放在额头上，抵抗手将头向后推的压力。这样做时，要有耐心。”他每周都会这样做两次，直到感到疲劳。",
  "Bryan’s protocol: at least 150 min a week of moderate activity (Zone 2) during which you can hold a conversation.": "布莱恩的协议：每周至少 150 分钟的中等活动（2 区），在此期间您可以进行对话。",
  "Bryan's protocol: mechanical shock signals osteoblasts to deposit minerals. Keep knees slightly soft to protect cartilage while the bone absorbs the force.": "布莱恩的方案：机械冲击向成骨细胞发出沉积矿物质的信号。保持膝盖稍微柔软，以保护软骨，同时骨骼吸收力量。",
  "Bryan’s published options for bodyweight HIIT: jumping jacks, high knees, mountain climbers, burpees without the push-up, jump squats, plus marching and bodyweight squats for beginners.": "布莱恩发布的自重 HIIT 选项包括：开合跳、高膝训练、登山、不带俯卧撑的立卧撑跳、深蹲跳，以及适合初学者的行进和自重深蹲。",
  "Bryan's rule: injury prevention comes first. Swap to the easier variant whenever a joint complains; never train through sharp pain.": "布莱恩规则：预防伤害第一。每当关节出现问题时，就更换为更简单的变体；切勿在剧烈疼痛的情况下进行训练。",
  "Bryan's video or post": "布莱恩的视频或帖子",
  "Bryan's weekly targets card in Activity → This week: strength, Zone 2, hard cardio, jumps, balance, mobility and posture.": "布莱恩在活动中的每周目标卡 → 本周：力量、第 2 区、有氧运动、跳跃、平衡、灵活性和姿势。",
