  "Get up for 2–3 minutes every 30 minutes. Switch between sitting and standing, as Bryan does at his desk. An under-desk treadmill works well for these breaks.": "每 30 分钟起床 2-3 分钟。在坐姿和站姿之间切换，就像布莱恩在办公桌前所做的那样。办公桌下的跑步机非常适合这些休息时间。",
