  "Grip strength predicts longevity": "握力预测寿命",
  "Grip the bar slightly wider than shoulder-width and let your body hang without swinging.": "握住杠铃，握距略宽于肩宽，让身体悬垂，不要摆动。",
  "Grip the bar with two hands, feet off the floor. Breathe steadily and hold as long as possible until grip gives out.": "用两只手抓住杠铃，双脚离开地板。平稳呼吸并尽可能长时间地保持，直到握力消失。",
  "Grip the bar with your palms facing away, slightly wider than shoulder-width.": "手掌朝外握住杠铃，握距略宽于肩宽。",
  "Grip the bar with your palms facing you, shoulder-width apart.": "手掌面向自己，握住杠铃，距离与肩同宽。",
  "Grip the pull-up bar with an overhand grip, slightly wider than shoulder-width.": "正手握住引体向上杆，握距略宽于肩宽。",
  "Grips no longer pop through their rotation mid-rep; handles turn through the shortest step instead.": "握把不再在重复次数中途突然弹出；手柄会通过最短的步骤转动。",
  "Grouped progress intervals include This week, Last week, This month, Last month and Since beginning.": "分组进度间隔包括本周、上周、本月、上个月和自开始以来。",
  "Guided exercise doses, set announcements, form cues during rest and spoken interval, hold and cardio timers.": "指导运动剂量、设置公告、在休息和说话间隔期间形成提示、保持和有氧运动计时器。",
  "Guided intervals show every round in order beneath the demonstration, including recovery breaks.": "指导间隔在演示下方按顺序显示每一轮，包括恢复休息。",
  "Guided navigation leaves completion unchanged; the progress bar reflects completed steps only.": "引导式导航使完成度保持不变；进度条仅反映已完成的步骤。",
  "Guided timed exercises now open with the timer already running in the right panel; Pause, Next and Stop sit beside it, and the old timer button is only a restart.": "现在打开引导定时练习，计时器已在右侧面板中运行；旁边有“暂停”、“下一步”和“停止”，而旧计时器按钮只是重新启动。",
  "Guided timed exercises show a compact Start timer card instead of starting on their own. Only one timer sits in the right panel, and stopping or logging it brings the Start card back for the next set.": "指导定时练习显示紧凑的开始计时器卡，而不是自行开始。右侧面板中只有一个计时器，停止或记录它会将开始卡带回下一组。",
  "Guided timers run in the same row as the value, in place of the timer button, and no longer push the form down.": "引导计时器在与值相同的行中运行，代替计时器按钮，并且不再向下推动表单。",
