  "Plan": "计划",
  "Plan change history now lives in Settings instead of the Plan page.": "计划更改历史记录现在位于“设置”而不是“计划”页面中。",
  "Plan change:": "计划变更：",
  "Plan change: A new, gentler set of workouts for New to training: supported or smaller-range moves, 1 to 2 sets, no jumps, swings or Nordics, shorter intervals and Zone 2.": "计划变更：针对训练新手的一套新的、更温和的训练：支持或较小范围的动作，1 到 2 组，无跳跃、摇摆或北欧式，较短的间隔和 2 区。",
  "Plan change: Added two optional Blueprint micro-routine add-ons in Settings: Bone density protocol (heel drops & stomp drills, pogo hops, and landing drills from Bryan's bone health guide) and Dead hang & grip (passive and active bar hangs and farmer's holds for spinal decompression and grip longevity).": "计划变更：在“设置”中添加了两个可选的蓝图微例程附加组件：骨密度协议（布莱恩骨骼健康指南中的脚后跟落下和跺脚练习、单高跷和着陆练习）和固定悬挂和握力（被动和主动杠铃悬挂以及农民保持脊柱减压和握力寿命）。",
  "Plan change: Changing your training level in Settings now switches you to that level's workouts: weights rescale and your phase restarts from the level's starting point.": "计划更改：在“设置”中更改训练级别现在会将您切换到该级别的锻炼：权重重新调整，并且您的阶段从该级别的起点重新开始。",
  "Plan change: Clarified the setup notes for ATG split squats, single-leg toe touches, band pull-aparts, standing external rotation, side planks and side-to-side leg swings.": "计划变更：澄清了 ATG 分腿深蹲、单腿触趾、弹力带拉开、站立外旋、侧平板支撑和左右腿部摆动的准备说明。",
  "Plan change: Combined warm-ups and exercise variations now appear as separate movements. Guided pairs alternate one set at a time, keeping the existing doses.": "计划变更：组合热身和运动变化现在显示为单独的动作。指导双人组一次交替一组，保持现有剂量。",
  "Plan change: Phases (Re-entry, Build, Blueprint), their automatic advance after 12 and 24 sessions, the phase lock and the starting-phase setting.": "计划变更：阶段（重新进入、构建、蓝图）、12 和 24 个会话后自动推进、阶段锁定和起始阶段设置。",
  "Plan change: Scheduled Zone 2 and controlled vigorous cardio scale by level toward Bryan’s weekly targets of 150 minutes of Zone 2 and 75 minutes of hard cardio.": "计划变更：安排 2 区并按级别控制剧烈有氧运动规模，以实现 Bryan 每周 150 分钟 2 区和 75 分钟剧烈有氧运动的目标。",
  "Plan change: Setup no longer asks you to pick a starting phase: your training level decides it. \"Well trained\" now starts in Blueprint (was Build).": "计划更改：设置不再要求您选择起始阶段：您的训练水平决定它。 “训练有素”现在从蓝图（之前是构建）开始。",
  "Plan change: Side-to-side leg swings say \"Stand tall with one hand on the wall\" (the animation stands square, not side-on).": "计划变更：从一侧到另一侧的腿部摆动表示“站直，一只手放在墙上”（动画是方形站立，而不是侧向站立）。",
  "Plan change: Single-leg balance and the forehead-resistance hold no longer state a fixed time or count that differs from your level; their animation cues now point to the time or holds your level prescribes.": "计划变更：单腿平衡和前额阻力保持不再规定与你的水平不同的固定时间或次数；他们的动画提示现在指向时间或保持您规定的级别。",
  "Plan change: Step-ups use a low aerobic step; Poliquin heel taps start on a slant board on the floor, with matching animations.": "计划改变：进阶使用低有氧步； Poliquin 脚跟轻拍从地板上的斜板上开始，并带有匹配的动画。",
  "Plan change: Well trained includes all target cardio without extra walks; keeping the strength work makes sessions 72 to 93 minutes.": "计划变更：训练有素，包括所有目标有氧运动，无需额外步行；保持力量训练使训练时间为 72 至 93 分钟。",
  "Plan change: Your training level alone now sets the workouts. Each of the four levels (New to training, Returning, Active, Well trained) has its own sets, reps, intervals and Zone 2 minutes; nothing moves on by itself. Your weight, sex and age still scale the suggested weights.": "计划变更：现在仅由您的训练水平决定锻炼。四个级别（训练新手、回归者、活跃者、训练有素）中的每一个都有自己的组数、次数、间隔和 2 分钟区域；没有任何事情会自行发展。您的体重、性别和年龄仍然符合建议体重。",
