  "Spend 2–4 minutes decompressing the spine and building elite grip strength. Includes passive hangs for disc hydration, active hangs for shoulder stability, and farmer's holds. Bryan's grip strength ranks in the top 5% for all ages.": "花 2-4 分钟为脊柱减压并增强握力。包括用于椎间盘水合作用的被动悬挂、用于肩部稳定性的主动悬挂以及农夫握点。布莱恩的握力在所有年龄段中均排名前 5%。",
  "Spend 3–4 minutes stimulating bone mineral density through high-impact ground-reaction loading. Includes heel drops & stomp drills, pogo hops and snap-down landings from Bryan's bone health protocol.": "花 3-4 分钟通过高冲击力地面反应负荷刺激骨矿物质密度。包括 Bryan 骨骼健康方案中的脚跟着地和跺脚练习、单高跷和快速落地。",
