  "Start around {weight} — adjust so you finish with the reps your level recommends.": "从 {weight} 开始 — 进行调整，以便您以您的级别推荐的次数完成。",
  "Start around {weight} for {seconds} s.": "从 {weight} 开始，得到 {seconds} s。",
  "Start from a full hang; pull your chest to the bar, elbows driving down toward the ribs.": "从完全悬挂开始；将胸部拉向杠铃，肘部向下压向肋骨。",
