  "Start in a half squat, then jump upward.": "从半蹲开始，然后向上跳。",
  "Start in a straight-arm plank with your hands under your shoulders.": "从直臂平板支撑开始，双手放在肩膀下方。",
  "Start interval timer": "启动间隔定时器",
  "Start on a slant board on the floor, working heel elevated, with the other leg reaching forward. The board alone gives a small heel tap; do not balance a large board on a narrow aerobic step.": "从地板上的斜板上开始，脚跟抬高，另一条腿向前伸展。单独的板子会产生轻微的脚后跟敲击声；不要在狭窄的有氧台阶上平衡大木板。",
  "Start on your hands and knees.": "从你的手和膝盖开始。",
  "Start set timer": "启动设定定时器",
  "Start standing. Cross legs and lower to the floor, then stand back up. Subtract 1 point for each hand, forearm, knee, or side of leg that touches the floor.": "开始站立。双腿交叉并降低到地板上，然后站起来。每只接触地板的手、前臂、膝盖或腿侧扣 1 分。",
  "Start the local server to use voice coaching.": "启动本地服务器以使用语音指导。",
  "Start the rest timer automatically when you log a set": "当您记录一组时自动启动休息计时器",
  "Start training": "开始训练",
  "Start with 1–2 sets. Use a chair or wall for support, or a smaller range of motion, while you learn the positions.": "从 1-2 组开始。在学习姿势时，使用椅子或墙壁作为支撑，或进行较小的运动范围。",
  "Start with a few minutes of easy movement, then dynamic exercises, as in Bryan’s official warm-up. Hops and balance come from his bone protocol and five exercise pillars.": "从几分钟的轻松运动开始，然后进行动态练习，就像布莱恩的官方热身一样。跳跃和平衡来自他的骨骼协议和五个锻炼支柱。",
  "Start with a small range of motion and increase it each week.": "从小范围的运动开始，每周增加一次。",
  "Start with feet lightly supported if needed. Alternate between relaxing into a passive hang (spine decompression) and engaging the active hang (shoulders pulled down).": "如果需要的话，从轻微支撑脚开始。在放松被动悬挂（脊柱减压）和主动悬挂（肩膀向下拉）之间交替进行。",
  "Start with supported exercises, 1–2 sets and light weights. There are no jumps.": "从支持练习开始，进行 1-2 组和轻重量。没有跳跃。",
  "Start with supported exercises, 1–2 sets and light weights. There are no jumps. Effort 4–5 out of 10: stop each set with 5 or more easy reps left.": "从支持练习开始，进行 1-2 组和轻重量。没有跳跃。 10 次中的 4-5 次努力：每组完成 5 次或更多简单次数后停止。",
