  "Straight legs: 30–50 reps in as few sets as possible": "直腿：30-50 次，尽可能少的组数",
  "Strength": "力量",
  "Strength A · Squat, push, pull + knees": "力量A·深蹲、推、拉+膝盖",
  "Strength B · Pull, knees & mobility": "力量 B·拉力、膝盖和灵活性",
  "Strength C · Power, lunge, press + tendons": "力量 C·爆发力、弓步、推举 + 肌腱",
  "Strength days take the template’s basics (squat, push-up, row, swing, lunge, presses, step-up, carry, planks) and add his signature Knees-Over-Toes and high-rep posture work.": "力量训练日采用模板的基础知识（深蹲、俯卧撑、划船、摆动、弓步、推举、踏步、抱举、平板支撑），并添加他标志性的膝盖过脚趾和高次数姿势练习。",
  "Strength includes lunges, overhead and floor presses, step-ups, swings and carries alongside his signature exercises.": "力量包括弓步、过头推举和地板推举、上台阶、摆动和负重以及他的标志性练习。",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri with progressive overload, short intervals Tue, Norwegian 4×4 Thu (start with 2–3 rounds, hard but controlled), easy outdoor or social activity Sat, recovery Sun. At least 150 min Zone 2 and 75 min hard cardio, about 10 of them near max.": "周一/周三/周五进行强度渐进式超负荷训练，周二短时间间隔，周四挪威式 4×4（从 2-3 轮开始，困难但受控），周六轻松的户外或社交活动，周日恢复。至少 150 分钟第 2 区和 75 分钟硬有氧运动，其中大约 10 分钟接近最大值。",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri, short intervals Tue and Norwegian 4×4 Thu follow Bryan’s template. Saturday adds controlled vigorous work to the indoor Zone 2 session to meet his weekly totals.": "周一/周三/周五的强度训练、周二的短距离训练和周四的挪威 4×4 训练遵循 Bryan 的模板。周六在室内 2 区训练中增加了受控的剧烈运动，以达到每周的总训练量。",
