  "Swing one leg across your body and out to the side, keeping your hips facing forward.": "将一条腿跨过身体并向一侧摆动，保持臀部朝前。",
  "Swing one leg forward and backward without arching your back.": "向前和向后摆动一条腿，不要拱起背部。",
