  "Trail run": "越野跑",
  "Train strength on Monday, Wednesday and Friday, do short intervals on Tuesday and the Norwegian 4×4 on Thursday, then mixed cardio on Saturday. Rest on Sunday. Zone 2 and controlled vigorous blocks build toward Bryan Johnson's weekly cardio targets. His public protocol is adapted here for bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "周一、周三和周五进行力量训练，周二进行短时间间隔训练，周四进行挪威 4×4 训练，然后周六进行混合有氧运动。周日休息。 2 区和受控的剧烈区块旨在实现 Bryan Johnson 的每周有氧运动目标。他的公共协议在这里针对体重、可调节哑铃、引体向上杆和弹力带进行了调整。",
