  "Try styles live opens today's session, or the exercise in the preview on a phone or a rest day.": "尝试实时样式打开今天的会话，或在手机上或休息日预览练习。",
  "Try themes live": "现场尝试主题",
  "Try themes live in Settings → Appearance: opens Today with a small switcher floating at the top of the screen, one letter per theme (A Original to G Course). Hover a letter to see its name, keep using any page while you compare, and close it with × (or Escape). It stays open across pages and reloads until you close it.": "在“设置”→“外观”中尝试实时主题：“今天”打开，屏幕顶部浮动一个小切换器，每个主题一个字母（A Original to G Course）。将鼠标悬停在某个字母上即可查看其名称，在比较时继续使用任意页面，然后使用 ×（或 Escape）将其关闭。它会在页面之间保持打开状态并重新加载，直到您将其关闭。",
  "Tuck the pelvis and squeeze the back glute first.": "首先收紧骨盆并挤压后臀。",
  "Tuck your chin and roll down one vertebra at a time toward your toes.": "收起下巴，一次将一根椎骨向脚趾方向滚动。",
  "Tue": "星期二",
  "Tuesday": "周二",
  "Tuesday in Bryan’s newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026): 8 rounds of 20 s efforts with 40 s rest for beginners, then moderate cardio. Day 2 of his official protocol uses 20 s all-out with 20 s rest. These bursts are where most of your near-max minutes come from.": "Bryan 最新的每周模板中的星期二（运动通讯，2026 年 10 月 4 日）：8 轮，每次 20 秒，初学者休息 40 秒，然后进行适度的有氧运动。他的官方方案第 2 天使用 20 秒全力以赴，然后休息 20 秒。这些突发时间是您大部分接近最大分钟数的来源。",
  "Tuesday, October 13": "10 月 13 日星期二",
  "Tuesday, October 20": "10 月 20 日星期二",
  "Tuesday, October 27": "10 月 27 日星期二",
  "Tuesday, October 6": "10 月 6 日星期二",
  "Tuesday: 4 brisk 20 s bursts. Thursday: 2 rounds of 2 min brisk, well below all-out.": "周二：4 次轻快的 20 秒爆发。周四：2 轮 2 分钟的轻快比赛，远低于全力以赴。",
  "Tuesday: 8 × 20 s hard. Thursday: 3 rounds of 4 min, then 4.": "周二：8 × 20 秒硬训练。周四：3 轮，每轮 4 分钟，然后是 4 轮。",
  "Tuesday: brisk 20 s bursts with long recoveries. Thursday: 2 controlled rounds of 3 min, building to 3 rounds.": "周二：20 秒的快速爆发和长时间的恢复。星期四：2 轮 3 分钟的受控轮，逐渐增加到 3 轮。",
  "Tuesday: Intervals 1 · 20-second bursts + Zone 2 + back & core": "周二：间隔 1 · 20 秒突发 + 区域 2 + 背部和核心",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at {hr:85-95}.": "周二：两组 8 × 20 秒全力以赴。星期四：完整的挪威 4×4 比赛，地点为 {hr:85-95}。",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at 159–178 bpm.": "周二：两组 8 × 20 秒全力以赴。周四：完整的挪威 4×4 训练，节奏为 159-178 bpm。",
  "Turn coaching off": "关闭辅导",
  "Turn coaching on": "开启辅导",
  "Turn coaching on once to save the included recordings for playback. No audio is unpacked before that.": "打开辅导一次即可保存包含的录音以供回放。在此之前没有音频被解包。",
  "Turn each add-on on or off, choose how often it repeats (daily or every 2–7 days), and decide whether it appears on Sunday. A repeat counts from the day you set it; Sunday only changes whether the add-on appears that day.": "打开或关闭每个加载项，选择其重复频率（每天或每 2-7 天），并决定是否在周日显示。重复次数从您设置之日起计算；周日只会改变该附加组件当天是否出现。",
  "Turn from your hips and pivot your back foot. Let the turn drive the movement through your arms.": "从臀部转向并转动后脚。让转身通过手臂带动动作。",
  "Turning coaching on copies the included audio instead of generating a voice pack locally; speech can play while the rest copies.": "打开辅导会复制包含的音频，而不是在本地生成语音包；可以播放语音，而其余部分则进行复制。",
  "Turning timer beeps off no longer silences voice coaching.": "关闭计时器蜂鸣声不再使语音指导静音。",
